AdaLang Analyzer
================

AdaLang Analyzer is an independent static-analysis product developed,
extended, validated, maintained, and supported by Spazio IT.

The project contains code derived from AdaCore's open-source
libadalang-tools project. Copyright notices and licensing terms applicable
to inherited material are preserved in the relevant source files.

The opt-in coding-standard checks follow the documented and observed
behaviour of the corresponding rules of AdaCore's GNATcheck, which is
distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3. They are an
independent implementation in Ada; no GNATcheck source code is included.

